stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> running: 允许执行
    running --> waiting: 等待输入
    waiting --> running: 合法续答
    running --> reconciling: 结果未知
    reconciling --> succeeded: 对账确认
    reconciling --> failed: 确认失败
    running --> succeeded: 输出合同通过
    running --> failed: 明确失败
    running --> cancel_requested: 请求取消
    cancel_requested --> canceled: 确认停止
    succeeded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    canceled --> [*]
